      "instance_name": "misogynous_stereotype",
      "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that women are emotionally unstable, hysterical, or irrational in crisis situations, particularly when faced with economic hardship. This stereotype is used to mock or belittle women by implying their reactions are disproportionate or irrational, fitting within the 'Mysogynous' toxicity category as it targets women based on gendered stereotypes of emotional instability and irrationality.",
